# ITS Site

Main site for Information Technology Services. 

## Theming

This repository contains a `watch.sh` command which constructs a `sass --watch (args)` command. This script looks at the sass folder and constructs arguments for each sub folder and corresponding css folder. Finally, it runs the command with all of the arguments. 

To run this, use the command `npm run watch`.

Please ensure you read the theme's README file as well for more information. 